# Copy to .env and fill in values. .env is gitignored.

# Google Gemini API key — used by Accruals::ReviewNarrator to generate
# 2-3 sentence Controller-facing narratives for flagged accruals.
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
